{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Tennessee","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Tennessee</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q131465595","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Tennessee","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Tennessee</span></span>"},"pageid":78508588,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Seal_of_Tennessee.svg/330px-Seal_of_Tennessee.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":331},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Seal_of_Tennessee.svg/960px-Seal_of_Tennessee.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":715,"height":718},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1379228315","tid":"c4604af2-c345-11f1-9cce-c14c63fb9f10","timestamp":"2026-10-08T18:26:24Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Tennessee"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Tennessee will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the nine U.S. representatives from the State of Tennessee, one from all nine of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Tennessee</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the nine U.S. representatives from the State of Tennessee, one from all nine of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections.</p>"}